{
 "id": "story-profetens-klage-og-haap-celtic",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/story-profetens-klage-og-haap-celtic",
 "offset_seconds": -2.800000000000196,
 "words_heard": 310,
 "words": 316,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "What misery is mine, gathering fruit after harvest",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like gleaning the vineyard when the grapes are gone",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not a cluster left to eat, not one early fig",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The faithful have vanished from the land entirely",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not one upright person remains among us",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They all lie in wait for blood in the dark",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one hunts his own brother with a net",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Both hands are skilled at weaving evil tight",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The official demands his price, the judge takes his bribe",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The powerful dictate what they want to do",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The best is like a briar, a hedge of thorns",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Confusion falls upon them all today",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is a God like you, who pardons guilt",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Passing over the transgression of his remnant",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You do not hold on to your anger forever",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For you delight in mercy, yes you do",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Put no trust in a neighbor or a friend",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Guard your mouth even from the wife in your arms",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A son treats his father with contempt",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A daughter rises against her mother now",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Enemies are the members of my own household",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Trust is broken and the bonds are torn",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But as for me, I will look to the LORD",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will wait for the God of my salvation",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is a God like you, who pardons guilt",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Passing over the transgression of his remnant",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You do not hold on to your anger forever",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For you delight in mercy, yes you do",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not gloat over me, my enemy",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Though I sit in darkness, the LORD is my light",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will bear his wrath until he hears me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is a God like you, who pardons guilt",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Passing over the transgression of his remnant",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You do not hold on to your anger forever",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For you delight in mercy, yes you do",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will hurl all our sins into the depths of the sea",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will show faithfulness to Jacob and Abraham",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
